<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-BOLAND 70-2 AT LUNCH AGAINST W.PROVINCE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BOLAND 70-2 AT LUNCH AGAINST W.PROVINCE.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boland were 70 for two at lunch against Western Province on the opening day of their four-day Supersport Series match at Newlands.</p>
<p>Scores: Boland 70-2 in 33 overs (Lloyd Ferreira 30 not out).</p>
